# skills: the field Magic page lists no skill. Flora in party slot 1 at level 28 (level index 27 pinned),
# when her battle list holds Water Bind and Binding Rain: the field page shows the game's own spells only
# (Healing Water, Tender Rain, Cure Squall, Divine Rain greyed as battle-only, Escape), with no blank or
# misnamed row after them (shots ff_page, and ff_down1 to ff_down5 after each Down). Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
pin u16 0x020B4650 3
pin u32 0x020b4778 27
wait 30
press X 3
wait 120
press Down 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
shot ff_page
press Down 8
wait 30
shot ff_down1
press Down 8
wait 30
shot ff_down2
press Down 8
wait 30
shot ff_down3
press Down 8
wait 30
shot ff_down4
press Down 8
wait 30
shot ff_down5
